  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pillar 1: 
Education: (80%)
- Supporting 1000 Lebanese, Syrian refugees, migrants, Palestinians and other nationalities Vulnerable Girls and Boys with retention support program at AL Fayhaa community center and 2200 Out of education children with referral services to bring them back to education in Tripoli and Minnieh-Dinnieh with specific focus on PWSN (persons with special needs).

Child protection: (20%)
- Providing these Children and additional children and Youth involved in child labor and street connected activities and their Caregivers (a total of 1040) with Different Protection Services like Case Management, Community Based PsychoSocial Support and Focussed PsychoSocial Support in Akkar, Tripoli, Minnieh-Dinnieh, Zgharta and El-Koura</narrative>
  </title>
